      ],
      "title": "绿洲空降作战·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "37507001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "留给我们的时间窗口是换班的10分钟。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "速战速决，各位准备好了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "风向恰好是西风……风速适宜。运气不赖，已经占据了天时呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "嘿嘿嘿哈哈哈，快等不及了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507005",
          "sourceType": 13,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "Standby,随时开始。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507006",
          "sourceType": 13,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "呼……嗯，我这也没有问题。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "那么……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "行动，开始！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿洲守卫A",
          "text": "嗯？这是什么声音……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿洲守卫B",
          "text": "啊……是眼泪。为什么我会如此感伤呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿洲守卫A",
          "text": "呜呜……我的家乡是一片茂密的丛林。可是，我已经永远无法回去了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿洲守卫C",
          "text": "喂，你们还在这里愣着干什么？\n西南方向有不明人物在……在开演唱会！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "……My flow就像利刃出鞘，punchline肉眼捕捉不到♫",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "不想听你们的唱词，除去学舌只剩枯燥♫",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "One eye更能看得清，斩断的何止烛台♫",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "Rhythm让你仔细听，胜负将由我独裁♫",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507017",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "守卫们在赶过来了，不能拖延太久……大家加油。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507018",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "与此同时，高空——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "呼——哈——好凉快啊啊啊——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "目前没有异常……嗯，那是什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "是执行空域侦察的无人机……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "绿洲果然有防范空中侵入的对策吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "喂，这样下去会直接撞上的！可恶……这里很难瞄准……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "不要紧，我来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507025",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "她拔剑，雷光自天际降下。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507026",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "轰——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "……！击坠了……真厉害。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "应该能伪装成电路故障，但瞒不了多久。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "那也足够了。我们已经越过墙壁了，准备降落！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "哈？怎么降落来着？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "3……2……1！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37507032",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "松手！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-913",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "angelbeats",
          "rowIds": [
            37507001,
