        }
      ],
      "title": "绿洲空降作战·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "37508001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "降落成功，你们感觉怎么样？看上去，我们还没有被发现呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "哈哈吼嘿，刺激，太刺激了。\n真想再来一回，回去就和梅根队长提议把这个列为必备训练科目。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "我也无事，可以继续执行计划。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508004",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "姑且落到了计划中的地点……\n在这里有一个「特别设置」的入口，连接着一条安全的通道。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508005",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "但是在哪里呢……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508006",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "好，找到了。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "百合，你的友人是重要的嫌疑人，通常会收容在绿洲的中央地带。而我们仍在设施的外侧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "是呢，得想办法进入设施里。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "请看，前方的那扇铁门用的是旧式门锁。这样的很轻松就能撬——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508010",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "轰——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "敌袭？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "喂喂，都过来，我把墙壁炸开了，里面是一条很宽敞的通道哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "啊，动静太大会把守卫引来的！算了，我们先从这个口子进去吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "等一下……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "怎么了，小乔？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "哦，我只是想提醒诸位，小心地上的碎石。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508017",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "嘿哈哈哈……向堡垒的深处进军！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508018",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "绿洲内部通道——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "运气还可以，一路过来畅通无阻。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "但愿如此……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508021",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "周围响起了急促的声音。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "什么啊，这听起来和警报一样的声响。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "你们有没有感觉……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "地板在震动。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "说起来，这条通道一直是倾斜的……不对，快跑！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "哇，又有刺激的来了，有个球在后面追我们！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508027",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "为什么——这种地方会有和「公会」一样的陷阱啊？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "可以的话，我也很想知道。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508029",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "一段时间后——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "总算……摆脱了那块大石头呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37508031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "嗯？这片区域是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-914",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
