      ],
      "title": "绿洲空降作战·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "37509001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "周围看上去就像是游乐场……绿洲里居然还有这样的地方？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37509002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "若我没认错，此处应是专供模范「住民」使用的……娱乐区域。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37509003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "娱乐区域？哎，还挺人性化的呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37509004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "被收容的住民可以凭劳动获取积分，用来兑换各种消费品以及特殊区域的限时使用权。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37509005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "那人都去哪了？这里就我们三个。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37509006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "总之不要放松警惕，先离开这里。前面的通道应该就是出口。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37509007",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "咚——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37509008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "哈？喂，出口突然被封住了啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37509009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "是屏蔽门……连我们过来的通道也堵上了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37509010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "……被摆了一道啊，看来又要有什么「惊喜」了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37509011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "飞猪雕像？",
          "text": "噗噗，不要紧张，来陪我玩个轻松愉快的游戏噗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37509012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "雕像在说话啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37509013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "飞猪雕像？",
          "text": "噗，规则很简单噗。游戏开始后，你们在起点线出发，用手触碰到我就算通关。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37509014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "只有这个要求？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37509015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "飞猪雕像？",
          "text": "噗噗，但是只有我在背对你们时，你们才能行动。如果我转回来看到有人还在动……机枪就会直接消灭她噗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37509016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "飞猪雕像？",
          "text": "游戏马上开始。时间到了还没站在起点线的小伙伴，也是要被消灭的噗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37509017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37509018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "啊？我没听清楚，能再重复一遍规则吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37509019",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "为什么这里的娱乐活动会这么残酷啊？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37509020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "飞猪雕像？",
          "text": "噗噗，噗噗——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "飞猪雕像？",
          "text": "噗噗，噗噗噗，噗噗，噗♫",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "啊烦死了，它哼的歌真难听！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "不到十步了……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "哈哈嘿吼，我一定会是第一个摸到那玩意的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "飞猪雕像？",
          "text": "噗噗♫",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602006",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "居然还在唱歌就突然转过来了……比之前都要快。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602007",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "果然开始耍诈了，大家应该都反应过来了吧？……哈莉？",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "唔……唔唔……!",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602009",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "不妙……哈莉她刚刚抬起腿，根本撑不了多久。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602010",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "这次的静止时间竟也比之前久……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "啊，已经不行啦——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602012",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "哒哒哒——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "唔！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602014",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "糟糕……她中枪了！\n现在可以确定，机枪转到不同方向是需要时间的……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "百合，我来吸引注意力！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "了解！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602017",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "哒哒哒——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602018",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "轰隆——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602019",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "哒哒哒——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602020",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "百合一个战术翻滚躲过了机枪的射界。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602021",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "嘿呀——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "碰到了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "飞猪雕像？",
          "text": "恭喜，游戏通关了噗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "哈莉……她最后的样子很安详。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "……我会记住她的。虽然有点急躁，但她是一位优秀的战线成员。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "啊，已经通关了？干得不错啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "哈？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "你们的表情怎么这么奇怪?",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37602029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "冲击力是有点大……但我这身校服可是防弹的哟~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-915",
