      "title": "绿洲空降作战·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "37510001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "绿洲外，某处山丘——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "怎么说呢，现在有一个好消息，还有一个坏消息。你想先听哪个？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "……我就知道你不会陪我玩。\n首先是好消息。有人先一步把绿洲搞得一团糟了，进攻的好机会。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "然后是坏消息，那伙人里有「边界行动队」的探子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "边界……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "她们想维持手办活动和人类世界的边界……追求双方互不干涉的理想状态。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "吹得很厉害对吧？\n明明只是一个以咖啡馆为幌子的情报机构，每天都要帮管理局做些不便出面的活……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "边界本应该是双向的。但她们顾得上的，却只有手办这一方呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "我无所谓，参与的势力多了，局面就会变得更加有乐子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "但要小心哦，今天的行动可不是从哪里取个快递那样容易的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "即使是对于你，还有……你们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "谢谢你的提醒。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "接下来，是「惩罚」的时间了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510015",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "与此同时——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "「她们」要来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "她们……是谁？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "她们是我的一部分，也是引发近期骚乱的犯人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "一部分？是……是和小奏同样型号的手办吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "不是的，是我的「分身」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "哦，原来是分身啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510022",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "完全没有明白！",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "如果有些不好的事情是因为你才发生的，你会怎么做？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "唔……自己的事情首先要自己想办法解决，这样才是正义的英雄呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "……知道了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "我们出去吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "啊？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "如果她们可能伤害到别人，我就有责任「亲自」阻止她们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "这样的话，才是「帅气的天使」的做法。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "但我们该怎么离开这里呢？我检查过，这里连房门都是铝合金的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "「音速手刃Ver.2」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510032",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "铛——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "把剑插进了门缝……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "「Version.3」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37510035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "……诶诶诶？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
